{"product":{"id":8082995740750,"title":"Calvin Klein Classics Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover three iconic Calvin Klein fragrances in one curated sample set. From fresh and clean citrus to aromatic woods and warm, spicy sweetness, this trio brings together different sides of the brand’s classic fragrance style.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCalvin Klein Eternity for Men Eau de Toilette\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A classic aromatic fragrance with fresh citrus, herbal notes and a smooth woody base. Clean, masculine and timeless.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCalvin Klein CK One\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A fresh unisex fragrance with bright citrus, green tea and soft woody-musky notes. Crisp, clean and easy to wear.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCalvin Klein CK One Shock\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A warmer, sweeter take on the CK One style, blending spicy, aromatic and woody notes with a smooth amber-tonka base. Casual, modern and inviting.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree Calvin Klein classics, three distinct styles — an easy way to experience the brand’s signature fragrances and find your everyday favorite.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-19T17:35:28+05:30","handle":"calvin-klein-classics-sample-set-eternity-for-men-edt-ck-one-ck-one-shock-3-1-5ml","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:54:40+05:30","published_at":"2026-09-23T12:34:52+05:30","template_suffix":"discovery-set","published_scope":"web","t